|---|---|---|---|
| Data quality | `01_data_quality.sql` | `01_exploration` §0 | A2, A3 |
| 1(a) Daily health | `02_daily_health.sql` | `01_exploration` | A4 |
| 1(b) Retention | `03_retention.sql` | `01_exploration` | Slide 2, A5 |
