## Scope

| Part | Status |
|---|---|
| 1, 2(a), 3, 4 | Done in full |
| 2(b) Sales | Screened only; conclusion needs a cadence experiment |
| 4(b) Value of a new install | Not attempted: only installs up to ~30 Jan have 90 days observed, and they are pre-ramp players unlike those UA buys now |
